    "combo1": {
      "title": "4-Card Eldam/Swen/Meghala/MST Line into Varuroon + Fonix",
      "description": "A resilient go-first opening on Radiant Typhoon Eldam, Swen, Meghala, and Mystical Space Typhoon that stays live even with a dead Droll & Lock Bird sitting in hand. Swen and Meghala Special Summon themselves, then Radiant Typhoon Vision is looped twice to turn Eldam and Mystical Space Typhoon into replacement cards, netting three copies of Ash Blossom & Joyous Spring and a Dominus Purge. The line closes by Link Summoning Radiant Typhoon Varuroon, the Marine Eidolon, setting a second Mystical Space Typhoon to prime Varuroon's Quick-Play trigger for later, and Special Summoning Radiant Typhoon Fonix, the Great Flame for the end board.",
